{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55649","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豪贵从他纵胜游，多欢终是复多愁。\n茅茨舍宇偏安稳，粪扫衣裳最自由。\n数片云飞书案上，一条泉路卧床头。\n分明自有安身处，争奈人间不肯休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}